        "original_id": "a3145fb4-fef3-5b12-838f-3dab6cf87cfd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wilhelm Heckmann\n- Organizations: Nazi concentration camps, Mauthausen–Gusen concentration camp\n- Places: Dachau, Mauthausen, Sankt Georgen an der Gusen, Upper Austria, Linz\n\nFacts:\n- From 1937 to 1945, Wilhelm Heckmann was imprisoned in the Nazi concentration camps at Dachau and Mauthausen.\n- Mauthausen–Gusen concentration camp was the hub of a large group of German concentration camps built around the villages of Mauthausen and Sankt Georgen an der Gusen in Upper Austria.\n- Mauthausen and Sankt Georgen an der Gusen were located roughly 20 km east of the city of Linz.",
